至", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200217_1474584.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.17 15:34:00", "doctitle": "为市民穿上无形“防护服”的疾控健教人", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1551923, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200217_1474584.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1474527, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200217_1474527.htm", "content": "\n　　为了切实指导、帮助社会公众科学使用口罩，国家相关部门形成了《社会公众使用口罩简易问答指南》，具体如下：\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200217_1474527.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.17 15:13:00", "doctitle": "社会公众使用口罩简易问答指南", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1551860, "sourcename": "上海疾控", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200217_1474527.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1474023, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200214_1474023.htm", "content": "\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200214_1474023.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.14 11:43:00", "doctitle": "防治新冠肺炎怎么吃？国家卫健委膳食指南来了！", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1551316, "sourcename": "人民日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200214_1474023.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1473765, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200213_1473765.htm", "content": "\n　　在新冠肺炎战“疫”中，如果说医护人员是身在一线的“战士”，那么从事流行病学调查的疾控人，就是前沿阵地上的“侦察兵”。 \n　　流行病学调查，简称“流调”。“流调”工作的目的，是调查疑似病例、确诊病例，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200213_1473765.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.13 15:48:00", "doctitle": "最美逆行者——战“疫”前线的“侦察兵”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1551036, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "——三明市疾控中心“流调”组记实", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200213_1473765.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1474018, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200214_1474018.htm", "content": "\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200214_1474018.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.13 11:20:00", "doctitle": "居家防疫，赠你10条锦囊妙计", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1551311, "sourcename": "福建日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200214_1474018.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1473120, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防",