docurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200202_1470915.htm", "content": "\n　　面对新型冠状病毒感染的肺炎疫情，很多人出现了焦虑、恐惧，过度恐慌，过度夸大疫情的实际危险性，不利于疫情防控。因此，居家百姓做好心理防护同样重要。\n　　1 疫情防控认知要科学 \n　　一定要从官方的渠道去", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200202_1470915.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.02 10:12:00", "doctitle": "抗击病毒，居家心理防护同样重要", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1547883, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/t20200202_1470915.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202002/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1470603, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470603.htm", "content": "\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470603.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.31 19:11:00", "doctitle": "一图读懂：做好老年人新型冠状病毒感染肺炎疫情防控工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1547545, "sourcename": "国家卫健委老龄健康司", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470603.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1470595, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470595.htm", "content": "\n　　  近来，新型冠状病毒肺炎防控形势严峻，全国各地医护人员驰援武汉，武汉同胞牵动无数中国人的心。此时此刻，每个人做好自我防护,就是为疫情防控尽一份力。预防冠状病毒，需要我们做些什么？为了您和家人的平安", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470595.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.31 17:46:00", "doctitle": "【新型冠状病毒科普知识】六大公众预防指南，请务必认真学习！", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1547537, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470595.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1470609, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470609.htm", "content": "\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470609.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.28 19:39:00", "doctitle": "一图读懂新型冠状病毒传播途径与预防指南！", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1547551, "sourcename": "中国疾控中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200131_1470609.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1470137, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200127_1470137.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，新型冠状病毒感染的肺炎疫情牵动着每一个人的心，关于口罩的各种问题也引发了极大关注。很多小伙伴提出，“用过的口罩，沾满了细菌、病毒，建议不要随意丢弃”，网络上也有人担心口罩被别有用心的人回收利", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200127_1470137.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.27 18:40:00", "doctitle": "科普：使用过的口罩该怎么处理？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1547009, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200127_1470137.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1469959, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200125_1469959.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）党委和政府，市直各单位： \n　　为贯彻《福建省人民政府关于启动重大突发公共卫生事件一级应急响应的通知》，切实抓好各项防控工作的落实，现就有关工作通知如下： \n　　一、落细落实市指挥部1号", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200125_1469959.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.25 22:16:00", "doctitle": "三明市新型冠状病毒感染的肺炎防控工作指挥部关于做好省启动特别重大突发公共卫生事件一级应急响应的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1546799, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200125_1469959.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1469948, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200125_1469948.htm", "content": "\n　　如何预防新型冠状病毒感染？ 可以从下面几点入手:\n　　一、正确戴口罩 市面上常见的口罩可以分为以下三类：\n　　➤ √医用外科口罩：可以阻挡70%的细菌，如果去公共场所、不与病人接触，佩戴医用外科口罩就足", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200125_1469948.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.25 15:45:00", "doctitle": "新型冠状病毒科普·预防篇| 如何正确戴口罩和洗手？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1546788, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200125_1469948.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1469895, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200124_1469895.htm", "content": "\n　　近期，湖北省武汉市等地区发生新型冠状病毒感染的肺炎疫情。疫情发生后，党中央、国务院高度重视。中共中央总书记、国家主席、中央军委主席习近平作出重要指示，湖北武汉市等地近期陆续发生新型冠状病毒感染的肺", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200124_1469895.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.24 11:58:00", "doctitle": "关于新型冠状病毒感染的肺炎 这些知识要知道", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1546734, "sourcename": "市疾控中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200124_1469895.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1469875, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200123_1469875.htm", "content": "\n　　为做好我市新型冠状病毒防控工作，1月17日下午，市疾控中心举办新型冠状病毒相关知识全员培训，中心领导及卫生专业技术人员共80余人参加此次培训。 \n　　培训班传达省卫健委新型冠状病毒感染肺炎防控工作电视电", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200123_1469875.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.23 18:52:00", "doctitle": "市疾控中心开展新型冠状病毒防控知识培训", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1546714, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200123_1469875.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1465321, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200114_1465321.htm", "content": "\n　　普通感冒不等于流感。普通感冒一般不发热，以打喷嚏，流鼻涕等症状为主，通常为自限性；流感的发热等全身症状比较重，卡他症状没有普通感冒突出，容易有肺炎等并发症。 \n　　如果家庭中已经有流感患者，在护理患", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200114_1465321.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.14 11:34:00", "doctitle": "流感来袭，家人中招了怎么办？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1541930, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200114_1465321.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1465301, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200114_1465301.htm", "content": "\n　　冬季是呼吸道传染病的高发季。呼吸道传染病是指病原体从人体的鼻腔、咽喉、气管和支气管等呼吸道感染侵入而引起的有传染性的疾病。常见的呼吸道传染病包括流行性感冒、麻疹、流行性腮腺炎、水痘、肺结核、猩红热", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200114_1465301.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.14 10:55:00", "doctitle": "预防呼吸道传染病，有哪些常用消毒方法？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1541909, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200114_1465301.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1464809, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200113_1464809.htm", "content": "\n　　自2020年1月1日起，福建全省范围内实施的脊髓灰质炎（脊灰）疫苗常规免疫程序从原来的“1+3”调整为“2+2”，即由1剂脊灰灭活疫苗（IPV）加3剂两价口服脊灰减毒活疫苗（bOPV），调整为2剂IPV加2剂bOPV。 \n　　新", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200113_1464809.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.13 08:18:00", "doctitle": "新年起，福建省儿童享受免费第2剂IPV疫苗啦！", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1541391, "sourcename": "福建省疾控中心网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200113_1464809.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1462738, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200106_1462738.htm", "content": "\n　　2019年12月31日,国家药监局发布消息称,该局已于近日批准首个国产HPV疫苗、首个国产13价肺炎结合疫苗的上市注册申请。这两种疫苗在对应人群中均有广泛的接种需求,国产产品的上市将显著提高相关疫苗的可及性。\n　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200106_1462738.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.06 10:37:00", "doctitle": "两个“重磅”国产疫苗获批上市", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1539180, "sourcename": "健康报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200106_1462738.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1462294, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200103_1462294.htm", "content": "\n　　1月2日是腊八节。在这一天，人们用农家自产的豇豆、糯米、高粱、花生、核桃、大红枣等多种杂粮和干果，煮成香喷喷的腊八粥。它颜色美丽，香甜味美，营养丰富。但怎样喝粥才是健康有益的呢？广东省中医院脾胃科主", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200103_1462294.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.03 16:27:00", "doctitle": "腊八要喝粥 怎样喝对有讲究", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1538650, "sourcename": "健康报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200103_1462294.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1462259, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "疾病预防", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200103_1462259.htm", "content": "\n　　12月27日，由中国健康教育与促进协会主办的“关爱妇女健康中国行”宫颈癌专题研讨会在我市顺利召开。会议旨在交流HPV感染相关疾病知识，学习宣传贯彻《疫苗管理法》。福建省预防医学会副会长洪荣涛主持会议，市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200103_1462259.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.03 16:05:00", "doctitle": "“关爱妇女健康中国行”宫颈癌专题研讨会在三明举行", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1538615, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/t20200103_1462259.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylws/jbyf/jbyf/202001/", "rels": []}]}